   <narrative xml:lang="EN">East Africa Hunger Relief Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Across East Africa, millions of people are facing famine. Climate-crisis-induced drought, regional and local conflict, and long-reaching impacts of the war in Ukraine and COVID-19 are creating a dire situation in multiple countries, including Ethiopia, Somalia, South Sudan, and Sudan. Your donation to the East Africa Hunger Relief Fund will provide emergency relief, food, water, medicine, and other essential supplies to people in need.</narrative>
  </description>
